<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i)) || \old(this.get(i)) == null;</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; 0<=i && i<index; (i < \old(this.size()) ? \old(this.get(i)) == this.get(i) : this.get(i) == null);</code>

This assertion ensures that for every valid index `i` less than the specified `index`, the element at that index remains unchanged or is `null` both before and after the `add` operation.
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>
